 from the enemies as you mow them down. Each train car is a unique level, taking you through what a passenger might have experienced. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game ends once you have reached the engine room and freed each car of hijackers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art style of Dungeon Train is low poly with liminal environments, this ambient direction contrasts the gun-heavy gameplay.</p>","developers":["Owen Black"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231190/header.jpg?t=1773461419","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3231190/2107182252/a504b359e5d90f1b9cac2b34ff28a2bff2dff106/1769709344/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769733795","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3231190/2107182252/a504b359e5d90f1b9cac2b34ff28a2bff2dff106/1769709344/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769733795","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3231190/2107182252/a504b359e5d90f1b9cac2b34ff28a2bff2dff106/1769709344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769733795","id":257275480,"name":"Dungeon Train Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257275480/b6d39fb1e052a413da708c2d1dc6d3edb8e19455/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769733795"}],"name":"Dungeon Train","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Dungeon Train - $1.99 USD","packageid":1145440,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Dun